# (63, 304), "Open alert for Escape test" (120, 350). The alert is closed with Return on its
# default button rather than a click measured on it.
# expect: log-contains alert opened
# Client coordinates (origin left empty): with origin=frame the clicks landed (38, 59) off, GTK's own title bar and shadow.
# Pass: Button 0 becomes Button 1 after Tab and Space; the alert is still up after Escape;
